  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/resource/scalable-meeting-room-standardization/#main-content)\n\n# BuildingaScalableModelforMeetingRoomStandardization\n\n![Neat’s beautifully simple video devices are easy to install, set up, and use.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Neats-beautifully-simple-video-devices-are-easy-to-install-set-up-and-use.png)\n\nAs meeting environments expand across rooms and locations, maintaining a consistent experience becomes more difficult. Differences in technology, workflows, and room setup can create friction for users while increasing support demands on IT teams.\n\nThis eBook outlines a practical framework for meeting room standardization, helping organizations create more consistent collaboration experiences that are easier to support, manage, and scale over time.\n\n## Meeting room standardization insights include:\n\n- Building a scalable framework for meeting room standardization\n\n- Reducing operational complexity across rooms and locations\n\n- Creating more consistent collaboration experiences for users\n\n- Improving room support, management, and governance workflows\n\n- Aligning meeting room design with accessibility and sustainability goals\n\n- Using operational visibility and data to support long-term performance\n\n### **Standardize Your Meeting Rooms with AVI-SPL**\n\nStandardizing meeting rooms at scale requires consistent design, operational planning, governance, and long-term support strategies. With these standards in mind, you’ll improve the experience for both users and IT teams.\n\n#### Read the eBook featuring solutions from leading providers including Neat, Q-SYS, and Shure.\n\nPlease fill out this quick form, and we’ll email you a link to the eBook.\n\nQuestions about meeting room standardization or workplace collaboration strategy? [Contact AVI-SPL](https://avispl.com/contact-us/) to continue the conversation.\n\nFirst name\\*\n\nLast name\\*\n\nWork email\\*\n\nCompany name\\*\n\nJob title\\*\n\nState\\*\n\nPlease SelectNon-USAAlabamaAlaskaArizonaArkansasCaliforniaColoradoConnecticutDistrict of ColumbiaDelawareFloridaGeorgiaHawaiiIdahoIllinoisIndianaIowaKansasKentuckyLouisianaMaineMarylandMassachusettsMichiganMinnesotaMississippiMissouriMontanaNebraskaNevadaNorth CarolinaNorth DakotaNew HampshireNew JerseyNew MexicoNew YorkOhioOklahomaOregonPennsylvaniaPuerto RicoRhode IslandSouth CarolinaSouth DakotaTennesseeTexasUtahVermontVirginiaWashingtonWest VirginiaWisconsinWyoming\n\nPosition in Funnel\n\nForm Type\n\nRegional Office\n\nAVI-SPL uses the information you provide us to bring you actionable content about unified communications, audio visual technology, events, and relevant products and services. You may unsubscribe from these emails at any time. For more information, see our [Privacy Policy](https://avispl.com/privacy-policy/).",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en-GB\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<body class=\"wp-singular resource-template-default single single-resource postid-20239 wp-custom-logo wp-theme-avi-spl resource-id-20239\" style=\"\">\n<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\n<div class=\"skip-link\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n    \t<a class=\"skip-link__btn\" href=\"https://avispl.com/resource/scalable-meeting-room-standardization/#main-content\" aria-label=\"Skip to main content\">Skip to main content</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"single-resource__head\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"single__wrap\">\n\t\t\t<h1 data-splitting=\"words\" class=\"words splitting\" style=\"--word-total: 8; opacity: 1;\"><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"Building\" style=\"--word-index: 0; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 62.2756% 0%, 62.2756% 62.2756%, 0% 62.2756%);\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">Building</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"a\" style=\"--word-index: 1; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 53.3467% 0%, 53.3467% 53.3467%, 0% 53.3467%);\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">a</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"Scalable\" style=\"--word-index: 2; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 42.8019% 0%, 42.8019% 42.8019%, 0% 42.8019%);\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">Scalable</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"Model\" style=\"--word-index: 3; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 30.4312% 0%, 30.4312% 30.4312%, 0% 30.4312%);\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">Model</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"for\" style=\"--word-index: 4; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 16.007% 0%, 16.007% 16.007%, 0% 16.007%);\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">for</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"Meeting\" style=\"--word-index: 5;\"><span>Meeting</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"Room\" style=\"--word-index: 6;\"><span>Room</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"Standardization\" style=\"--word-index: 7;\"><span>Standardization</span></span></h1>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"single-resource__head__featured\"><img width=\"950\" height=\"632\" src=\"https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Neats-beautifully-simple-video-devices-are-easy-to-install-set-up-and-use.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Neat’s beautifully simple video devices are easy to install, set up, and use.\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></div>\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"single-resource__main\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"single__wrap body-content\">\n\t\t\t\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As meeting environments expand across rooms and locations,&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;a consistent experience becomes more difficult. Differences in technology, workflows, and room setup can create friction for users while increasing support demands on IT teams.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This eBook outlines a practical framework for meeting room standardization, helping organizations create more consistent collaboration experiences that are easier to support, manage, and scale over time.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"h-meeting-room-standardization-insights-include\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Meeting room standardization insights include:</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Building a scalable framework for meeting room standardization&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Reducing operational complexity across rooms and locations&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Creating more consistent collaboration experiences for users&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Improving room support, management, and governance workflows&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Aligning meeting room design with accessibility and sustainability goals&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Using operational visibility and data to support long-term performance&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"h-standardize-your-meeting-rooms-nbsp-with-avi-spl-nbsp\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Standardize Your Meeting Rooms&nbsp;with AVI-SPL</strong>&nbsp;</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Standardizing meeting rooms at scale requires consistent design, operational planning, governance, and long-term support strategies. With these standards in mind,&nbsp;you’ll&nbsp;improve the experience for both users and IT teams.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"h-read-the-ebook-featuring-solutions-from-leading-providers-including-neat-q-sys-and-shure\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Read the eBook featuring solutions from leading providers including Neat, Q-SYS, and Shure.&nbsp;</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Please fill out this&nbsp;quick form, and&nbsp;we’ll&nbsp;email you a link to the eBook.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Questions about meeting room standardization or workplace collaboration strategy?&nbsp;<a href=\"https://avispl.com/contact-us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Contact AVI-SPL</a>&nbsp;to continue the conversation.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"custom-html-block\">\n \n\n<div id=\"hbspt-form-bbc111e9-12a0-411a-956e-1f41b3637808\" class=\"hbspt-form\" data-hs-forms-root=\"true\"><form id=\"hsForm_af62f01a-813a-4424-b728-b41fefe5ee74\" method=\"POST\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\"